module qs.Blobs

# A QML counterpart to the compiled blob plugin. The plugin meshes its members
# into one liquid field with shadows; this shim keeps the shell's API intact
# and gives an honest first render of the same geometry: each BlobRect is
# painted at its own geometry and color, so popouts, the frame island, and the
# camera overlay all appear. The melt and the deform matrix join when the
# compiled module replaces this directory, which is why the same properties,
# names, and defaults live here.
BlobGroup BlobGroup.qml
BlobRect BlobRect.qml
